# One line ending everywhere, checked out and stored.
#
# The tests read example programs and edit them by matching on their text. A
# checkout that turned those files into CRLF matched nothing, so the fixtures
# edited nothing and the tests went on to assert something other than what they
# said — silently, and only on Windows CI. `eol=lf` is what stops that from
# depending on a git setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, whatever a platform thinks.
*.png binary
*.wasm binary
